<Base title="About" description="AI Safety Timeline">
  <article class="prose-page">
    <h1 class="sr-only">About</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      <strong>In 2022, I came across a site called 80,000 Hours.</strong> From that, I was introduced to the worlds of Earning to Give and AI Safety.
    </p>
    <p>
      After graduation, I worked at LinkedIn as an AI Engineer for 3 years, donating 30% of my income during that period. In September of 2026, I quit my job at LinkedIn, attended ARENA 9.0, and started a full-time transition to the AI Safety field, which is where I find myself now.
    </p>
    <p>
      Asides from AI Safety I also love music, sports, getting closer with the people in my life, and a good book (am I right?).
    </p>
    <p>
      If you find yourself interested by any of my output, feel free to hit me up or meet in person in San Francisco!
    </p>
  </article>
</Base>
